# Splash cheat (80:F549): Up, Left, Up, R, A during the UNIRACERS title splash
# (frames ~283-393 from power-on). Use on a formatted save; an unformatted one is
# formatted after the splash and loses the unlock. tools/probe_tour_award_and_ending.py.
wait 300
press up 3
wait 3
press left 3
wait 3
press up 3
wait 3
press r 3
wait 3
press a 3
wait 3
until 009F == D7 3000
wait 20
dump splash-cheat-main
quit
